  "notes": "{見慣|みな}れる is a compound verb combining {見|み}る (to see) + {慣|な}れる (to become accustomed), meaning to become accustomed to seeing something.\n\nVERB TYPE: Ichidan verb (ru-verb), intransitive\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {見慣|みな}れた + noun (familiar ~): {見慣|みな}れた{顔|かお} (familiar face)\n- 〜に{見慣|みな}れる (to get used to seeing ~)\n- {見慣|みな}れない + noun (unfamiliar ~): {見慣|みな}れない{人|ひと} (unfamiliar person)\n\nRELATED COMPOUND VERBS:\n- {聞|き}き{慣|な}れる (to get used to hearing)\n- {食|た}べ{慣|な}れる (to get used to eating)\n- {使|つか}い{慣|な}れる (to get used to using)",
